    "## 5.1: Euclidean distance + DBSCAN\n",
    "\n",
    "The Euclidean distance function was manually implemented in task 4.1.  \n",
    "Since the function does not use any predefined distance functions or libraries, we reuse the same implementation here as the distance metric for DBSCAN."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 40,
   "id": "916fabf1-12e5-4f80-9ec4-c27cb0c6b139",
   "metadata": {},
